Entire Agent Flow

When Azure Container Instance starts container:

Image Downloaded
      ↓
Container Created
      ↓
WORKDIR Active
      ↓
Code Present
      ↓
Dependencies Installed
      ↓
python3 server.py
      ↓
Port 8098 Listening
      ↓
API Available


